+
+    <section id="create"><h2><span class="method">POST</span>/api/v1/conversations</h2><div class="card endpoint"><p>创建网页会话和对应 Telegram Topic。此接口使用集成密钥。</p><div class="code"><button class="copy" data-copy="create-curl">复制</button><pre id="create-curl">curl -X POST "$BASE/api/v1/conversations" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer API_KEY" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{
+    "visitor_name": "Ada",
+    "email": "ada@example.com",
+    "external_id": "customer-7",
+    "page_url": "https://www.example.com/pricing"
+  }'</pre></div><h3>201 Response</h3><pre>{"data":{"id":"wc_...","visitor_token":"wv_...","status":"open","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"}}</pre></div></section>
+
+    <section id="send"><h2><span class="method">POST</span>/api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages</h2><div class="card endpoint"><p>访客发送 1–4000 字符的文本。可选的 <code>reply_to_message_id</code> 会在网页与 Telegram Topic 两端保留引用关系。</p><div class="code"><button class="copy" data-copy="send-js">复制</button><pre id="send-js">await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/conversations/${conversationId}/messages`, {
+  method: "POST",
+  headers: {
+    "Authorization": `Bearer ${visitorToken}`,
+    "Content-Type": "application/json"
+  },
+  body: JSON.stringify({
