+<h2 dir="auto">管理员命令</h2>
+<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role="table">
+<thead>
+<tr>
+<th>命令</th>
+<th>作用</th>
+</tr>
+</thead>
+<tbody>
+<tr>
+<td><code class="notranslate">/protect on|off</code></td>
+<td>查看或设置之后发送的消息保护</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code class="notranslate">/delete</code>、<code class="notranslate">/del</code></td>
+<td>回复消息后双端删除</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code class="notranslate">/clear</code> + <code class="notranslate">/clear confirm</code></td>
+<td>清空双方消息，保留 Topic 和资料卡</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code class="notranslate">/clear_user</code> + <code class="notranslate">/clear_user confirm</code></td>
+<td>仅清空客户端消息</td>
