+<h1 dir="auto">ForumDesk</h1>
+<p dir="auto"><strong>Bridge Telegram DMs and website support chats into dedicated forum topics.</strong></p>
+<p dir="auto"><a href="README.md">简体中文</a> · <a href="API_EN.md">Web API</a> · <a href="examples/web-client_EN.md">Browser integration</a> · <a href="README_EN.html">Interactive docs</a></p>
+<p dir="auto"><a href="https://github.com/paipaiio/telegram-customer-service-bot/actions/workflows/docker.yml"><img src="https://github.com/paipaiio/telegram-customer-service-bot/actions/workflows/docker.yml/badge.svg" alt="Docker Build" style="max-width: 100%;"></a><br>
+<a href="go.mod"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/42a8119239952bdf2ce6b26d1b1c896936c9f84e80b36c23fa133857bd2a0cd2/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f476f2d312e32332d3030414444383f6c6f676f3d676f266c6f676f436f6c6f723d7768697465" alt="Go 1.23" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Go-1.23-00ADD8?logo=go&amp;logoColor=white" style="max-width: 100%;"></a><br>
